    pe: "Febrile, tachycardic, mildly tachypnoeic. BP 100/60. Mucous membranes: mild oral mucositis. Port-a-cath site: clean, no erythema, no discharge. Lungs clear. Abdomen soft, non-tender. No skin lesions.",
    vitals: "HR: 142 bpm, BP: 85/46 mmHg, RR: 36 breaths/min, Temp: 39.8°C, SpO2: 91%",
    labs: "ANC: 100 cells/mm3 (Severe Neutropenia). Hb 9.5. Platelets 55.000. CRP 150 mg/L. Procalcitonin 1.8 ng/mL. Creatinine 0.9. LFTs normal. Blood cultures: x2 sets drawn (peripheral + port). Urine culture: drawn. CXR: normal.",
